== Description ==

The '''Concrete Mixer''' mixes concrete and cement compounds for reinforced structures. It defines 3 raw recipe entries (3 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Cement]], [[Concrete]], [[Sand]].

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CementMixer</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Concrete_Mixer</code>.

